# Summary

The club charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution. The amount of this contribution is fixed in the annex of the charter[[cite:obs-2cc5ab1f488b2ab2f6796abbd04596f21b331a57 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]].

According to the annex, the ordinary contribution is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January[[cite:obs-31d60088773677cdfd1775ff9a6573fed3faf42c "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]].
